"subject": "[URGENT] Initial SAE Notification - BR-042-0127",
"date": "2025-02-03T08:12:00-05:00",
"body": "Hi Jennifer,\n\nWe are reporting a potential Serious Adverse Event for patient BR-042-0127 (initials J.K.) currently enrolled in study NCT00542451. The patient experienced symptomatic shortness of breath and was noted to have reduced LVEF during routine monitoring at Week 8 of therapy.\n\nWe have temporarily interrupted trastuzumab and paclitaxel per protocol. I am attaching the initial SAE form. Let me know if additional documentation is needed.\n\nBest regards,\nSarah Chen, CCRP\nClinical Research Coordinator | Memorial Cancer Center\nPhone: (555) 410-2332\n",
"attachments": [
{
"filename": "Initial_SAE_Form_BR-042-0127.pdf",
"content_type": "application/pdf",
"size_kb": 92
}
],
